==================================================
CONFIDENCE SCORING
==================================================

HIGH:
- AST parsed successfully
- symbol resolved
- evidence line available
- relationship verified by code/config

MEDIUM:
- AST parsed
- relationship likely but symbol partly unresolved

LOW:
- dynamic import
- reflection
- unresolved symbol
- heuristic-only inference

Never show LOW confidence findings as facts.

